      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying an impossible weight—the weight of their entire life story—and that is too much for one person to bear. Please know that your existence is not a debt you owe them, and your worth is not tied to your career achievements. If you are feeling like you can't keep going, it is incredibly important to reach out to a professional immediately. There are people who want to support you through this overwhelming pain.",
